mGBA Parallax source pin
========================

Instrumented source fork: https://github.com/buptrain/mgba-parallax.git
Fork commit: 91c4761abb86f74dcc66bac7347f0c4faa6e1540
Upstream mGBA base: https://github.com/mgba-emu/mgba.git
Upstream base commit: a67176cd3e6bf60a5016d7adc94357142dd12617
License: Mozilla Public License 2.0 (see the fork's LICENSE and NOTICE files)
Release channel: https://github.com/buptrain/mgba-parallax/releases

This file pins the ignored local checkout at third_party/mgba. Acquire it from
the instrumented fork, not upstream, when building the direct adapter or a
release candidate. The checkout itself is intentionally not committed into
this project. Each distributed binary must name its exact source tag/commit,
ABI version, and SHA-256 as published by the fork's release contract.
